OL,3,GNEWSACould Brussels sprouts be off the
OL,4,AChristmas menu?
OL,5,
OL,6,FLove them or hate them you will
OL,7,Fprobably find some sprouts on your
OL,8,Fplate for Christmas. Whether you choose
OL,9,Fto eat them however is up to you.
OL,11,FBut one organic farmer in Oxfordshire
OL,12,Fhas said the intense heat has created
OL,13,Fperfect conditions for a 'plague' of
OL,14,Fflea beetles that, unlike some, love to
OL,15,Ffeast on the brassica.
OL,17,FGeorge Bennet said his sprouts are
OL,18,F"touch and go" after a year that has,
OL,19,F"really pushed us to the limits". But
OL,20,Ffear not, there may still be hope for
OL,21,Fany Brussels buffs out there.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
