OL,3,GNEWSACould Brussels sprouts be off the
OL,4,AChristmas menu?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We will still have Brussels sprouts
OL,7,Fbut they are likely to be quite small,
OL,8,Fnot the big ones that are much easier
OL,9,Fto peel on your Christmas dinner."
